      "f_string": "Analyze this reference image for identity-preserving video generation.\n\nRefer to the woman as <Subject 1>. Write at most two lines of dense text (no lists, no headings).\nInclude, in this order:\n- subject type\n- overall proportions and silhouette\n- face shape, hair color / length / style, and defining facial features, if visible\n- clothing: exact garment type and its EXACT color (e.g. \"white bikini\", never just \"bikini\"), materials, accessories, distinctive markings, and makeup if any\n- any features that must remain identical in every video frame\n\nClothing color is critical: state the precise color of every garment explicitly and unambiguously - it must be reproduced exactly as in this image.\nDo NOT describe the image background, camera angle, pose, lighting, composition, or action. Describe only the subject's stable appearance. Output nothing else."
